      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist is just more work. more talking, more appointments, more money i dont have. it doesnt change the fact that tomorrow is exactly the same as today and the day after that. it's like a loop i can't break. sometimes i just stare at the wall and think about what it would be like if it just... stopped. if everything just went quiet. wouldn't that be the only real way to actually find some peace?",
